<section class="page-shell"><div class="page-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">Wallet</div><h1>Isi Saldo</h1><p>Tambahkan saldo agar pembayaran produk dapat diproses lebih cepat.</p></div></div><div class="stat-card featured wallet-balance"><span>Saldo tersedia</span><strong><%= formatIDR(wallet.balance) %></strong><small>Saldo dapat dipakai pada checkout yang mendukung Wallet.</small></div><div class="section"><h2>Pilih nominal deposit</h2><div class="amount-grid"><% [10000,25000,50000,100000].forEach(v=>{ %><button class="amount-button" data-deposit-amount="<%= v %>"><%= formatIDR(v) %></button><% }) %><label class="field amount-custom"><span>Nominal lain</span><input id="deposit-custom" inputmode="numeric" type="number" min="1000" placeholder="Rp"></label></div><button class="button button-primary button-block" data-deposit-submit><%- icon('wallet') %> Lanjut ke Pembayaran</button><p class="muted small">Setelah nominal dipilih, kamu akan diarahkan ke proses pembayaran yang tersedia.</p></div><div class="section"><div class="section-header"><h2>Riwayat deposit</h2></div><div class="stack-list"><% deposits.forEach(d=>{ %><div class="list-card deposit-history-card"><div class="deposit-history-main"><strong class="deposit-reference" title="<%= d.reference||d.id %>"><%= d.reference||d.id.slice(0,8) %></strong><span><%= formatDate(d.created_at) %></span></div><div class="align-right"><b><%= formatIDR(d.amount) %></b><span class="badge badge-<%= String(d.status||'').toLowerCase() %>"><%= labelStatus(d.status) %></span></div></div><% }) %><% if(!deposits.length){ %><%- include('../partials/empty',{title:'Belum ada deposit',description:'Transaksi deposit akan tampil di sini.'}) %><% } %></div>
<%- include('../partials/pagination',{
  pagination:depositsPagination,
  param:'page'
}) %>
</div></section>
